      "openP0P2": 0,
      "coverage": "The frozen patch d87a3be..7a01895 (installed 1.2.21 to this release) was reviewed at 91aa074 by both reviewers and then delta by delta (91aa074..f6c1466, f6c1466..594b7b6); 594b7b6..7a01895 adds only a reviewer-requested P3 fix (the gate log pump keeps draining after a failed log write, covered by tests/ReleaseOrchestrator.Tests.ps1) and the release notes. Every P0-P2 finding (GateProcess give-up dispose crash; forward/previous autoload round trip) was fixed and re-confirmed by both reviewers. Open P3 follow-ups: GateProcess Kill confirms only the root process exit; -Cpus is not part of the WSL result-cache key (pre-existing); browser regression tests for autoload use synthetic days rather than the real component; a previous-direction click skipped while a window move is pending is not resumed (by design, forward-only resume); the Mac HarnessProcess first-run fix is unverified on the Mac (unreachable over SSH).",
